WEBVTT

00:08:58.625 --> 00:09:00.709
that the idea of disposability

00:09:01.566 --> 00:09:05.676
not only hurts the species
we've talked about,

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:08.451
but it even corrupts our own society.

00:09:08.475 --> 00:09:11.452
We're so proud to live here in California.

00:09:11.476 --> 00:09:13.562
We just had this vote,
and everybody's like,

00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:15.324
"Well -- not in our state!"

00:09:15.348 --> 00:09:16.869
(Laughter)

00:09:16.893 --> 00:09:19.676
I don't know what those
other states were doing, but ..."

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.442
(Laughter)

00:09:21.466 --> 00:09:23.065
Just so proud.

00:09:24.061 --> 00:09:26.412
And, yeah, I'm proud, too.

00:09:26.436 --> 00:09:27.608
But ...

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:32.676
California, though we lead the world
in some of the green stuff,